# TRON Wallet Tracing Exercise — Behavioral Analysis of a Publicly Reported Scam Wallet

## Executive Summary

This repository contains a blockchain tracing exercise involving a publicly reported TRON wallet associated with investment-fraud complaints.

The purpose of this analysis is not to make ownership claims, but to demonstrate how investigators approach an unfamiliar wallet and identify behavioral patterns that may warrant additional investigation.

Key focus areas include:

- Collection wallet behavior
- Transaction flow analysis
- Wallet clustering opportunities
- Exchange exposure
- Layering indicators
- Behavioral consistency across counterparties

